body:
flowchart TD
  A[Confession challenged as involuntary] --> B{Coercive STATE / police activity?<br/>Connelly}
  B -- No --> V[Voluntary - admissible<br/>internal compulsion alone is not enough]
  B -- Yes --> C{Did that coercion CAUSE the statement<br/>and overbear the will?<br/>totality: duration - deprivation - threats/promises - force/drugs - suspect traits}
  C -- No --> V
  C -- Yes --> D[Involuntary - inadmissible under Due Process<br/>Brown - Ashcraft - Spano - Rogers]
  D --> E{Erroneously admitted at trial?}
  E -- Yes --> F[Trial error - harmless-error review<br/>Chapman / Fulminante]
  A -. federal arrests only .-> G{Unnecessary presentment delay?<br/>McNabb-Mallory - 3501 six-hour safe harbor - Corley}
  G -- Yes --> H[Suppress in federal court<br/>separate from constitutional voluntariness]

flowchart TD
    A[Statement by suspect] --> B{Custody?<br/>objective: formal arrest OR<br/>arrest-equivalent restraint}
    B -- No --> N[No warnings required<br/>e.g. traffic stop · voluntary interview]
    B -- Yes --> C{Interrogation?<br/>express questioning OR<br/>functional equivalent — Innis}
    C -- No --> N2[No warnings required<br/>e.g. volunteered statement · undercover agent]
    C -- Yes --> D{Public-safety<br/>danger? — Quarles}
    D -- Yes --> E[Unwarned safety question<br/>answer + weapon admissible]
    D -- No --> W[Miranda warnings required<br/>+ valid waiver before questioning]

flowchart TD
  Q{"Public employee ordered to give a statement<br/>at an internal-affairs / administrative interview"}
  Q --> C{"Was the statement COMPELLED?<br/>(given under threat of discipline / discharge for silence)"}
  C -->|"No — truly voluntary,<br/>no penalty for silence"| V["Voluntary statement<br/>USABLE criminally<br/>(subject to <i>Miranda</i> / voluntariness if custodial)"]
  C -->|"Yes — compelled on pain of job loss"| G["<b>Garrity immunity attaches</b><br/>statement + fruits INADMISSIBLE in a<br/>subsequent CRIMINAL case (<i>Garrity</i> · <i>Lefkowitz</i>)"]
  G --> W{"Did the employer compel it the RIGHT way?"}
  W -->|"Compelled duty-related answers<br/>UNDER IMMUNITY (no waiver demanded)<br/><i>Gardner</i> · <i>Lefkowitz</i> · <i>Kalkines</i> warning"| OK["Lawful: employee must answer or face<br/>discipline; answers can't be used criminally"]
  W -->|"Fired merely for invoking privilege,<br/>OR forced to WAIVE immunity"| BAD["Unlawful discharge / waiver<br/>(<i>Gardner</i> · <i>Lefkowitz</i>)"]
  OK --> L{"Employee's response"}
  L -->|"Stays silent (immunized) or answers truthfully"| PROT["Protected — no criminal use of compelled answers"]
  L -->|"Lies to investigators"| LIE["NOT protected — agency may discipline<br/>the false statement (<i>LaChance</i>)"]
  OK -. "federal investigatory exam that<br/>may lead to discipline" .-> REP["Statutory union-representation right<br/>on request — FSLMRS, NOT 5A (<i>NASA v. FLRA</i>)"]

flowchart TD
    A[Identification challenge] --> B{Which doctrine?}
    B -->|6A right to counsel| C{Adversary proceedings begun<br/>attachment? Kirby / Rothgery}
    C -->|No: pre-charge| D[No right — Kirby]
    C -->|Yes: post-attachment| E{Corporeal lineup?}
    E -->|No: photo array| F[No right — Ash]
    E -->|Yes: lineup| G[Right to counsel — Wade / Gilbert<br/>uncounseled lineup ID excluded per se;<br/>in-court ID needs independent source]
    B -->|Due process suggestiveness| H{Suggestion arranged by police? Perry}
    H -->|No| I[No pretrial screen — Perry<br/>cross-exam + jury instructions]
    H -->|Yes| J{Unnecessarily suggestive?}
    J -->|No| K[Admissible]
    J -->|Yes| L{Reliable under totality?<br/>Biggers / Manson five factors<br/>vs. corrupting effect}
    L -->|Yes| K
    L -->|No| M[Suppress — Stovall / Foster]

flowchart LR
    M["1924 Milam<br/>(auto · 4th Cir.)"] -->|expands| C["1925 Carroll<br/>(auto)"]
    C -->|expands| L["1927 Lee<br/>(searchlight)"]
    L -->|expands| O["1928 Olmstead<br/>(wiretap)"]
    O -->|"overruled by Katz →"| W["1949 Wolf<br/>(incorporation: right)"]
    W -->|"incorporation"| MP["1961 Mapp<br/>(exclusion: remedy)"]
    MP -->|contracts| K["1967 Katz<br/>(privacy / REP)"]
    K -->|contracts| KY["2001 Kyllo<br/>(thermal)"]
    KY -->|contracts| R["2014 Riley<br/>(phone)"]
    R -->|contracts| CP["2018 Carpenter<br/>(CSLI)"]

    classDef expand fill:#fde2e2,stroke:#b91c1c,color:#111;
    classDef contract fill:#dceefb,stroke:#1d4ed8,color:#111;
    classDef incorp fill:#e7e0fb,stroke:#6d28d9,color:#111;
    class M,C,L,O expand;
    class K,KY,R,CP contract;
    class W,MP incorp;

flowchart TD
  Q{"Did the suspect retain a reasonable<br/>expectation of privacy in the item/area?<br/><i>(denial · discard · location · intent)</i>"}
  Q -->|"No — relinquished"| V{"Was the relinquishment voluntary —<br/>NOT the product of unlawful police conduct?"}
  V -->|Yes| AB["Abandoned → no standing<br/>Greenwood · Abel · Hester"]
  V -->|"No (forced by illegal stop/seizure)"| TAINT["Not valid abandonment<br/>(tainted — fruit of the poisonous tree)"]
  Q -->|"Yes — REP retained"| BAIL["REP retained<br/>(e.g. bailment · Bond)"]
  BAIL --> C{"Consent by one with common<br/>authority? → Consent Searches (Matlock)"}
  C -->|Yes| OK["Search may proceed"]
  C -->|No| WAR["Need a warrant or another exception"]

flowchart TD
  A["Surveillance of protected space"] --> B{"Naked eye, or a sense-enhancing device?"}
  B -->|"Naked eye / ordinary camera"| C{"From public navigable airspace<br/>(a vantage the public may occupy)?"}
  C -->|Yes| N["Not a search<br/>Ciraolo (1,000 ft) · Riley (400 ft)<br/>Dow (commercial open areas)"]
  C -->|"No — trespass / non-public vantage"| S1["Separate inquiry<br/>(entry / trespass · Curtilage)"]
  B -->|"Device NOT in general public use"| D{"Reveals the interior of a home?"}
  D -->|Yes| SR["SEARCH — warrant required<br/>Kyllo (thermal imager)"]
  D -->|"No — only exposed exterior"| N

flowchart TD
  A["Area near the home"] --> D["Apply the four <b>Dunn</b> factors:<br/>1 · proximity to the home<br/>2 · within the enclosure surrounding the home<br/>3 · nature of the use<br/>4 · steps taken to shield from observation"]
  D --> Q{"So intimately tied to home life<br/>that it is part of the home?"}
  Q -->|No| OF["OPEN FIELDS — no 4A protection<br/>(Hester · Oliver)<br/>fence / 'No Trespassing' irrelevant"]
  Q -->|Yes| CU["CURTILAGE — part of the home"]
  CU --> E{"Physical entry to<br/>gather evidence?"}
  CU --> O{"Only observed from<br/>a lawful vantage?"}
  E -->|"within implied license:<br/>front path · knock · wait · leave"| NS["Not a search"]
  E -->|"exceeds license (e.g. drug dog),<br/>or no warrant / exception"| S["SEARCH — needs warrant<br/>or exception (Jardines · Collins)"]
  O -->|"lawful-vantage observation"| N2["Not a search here<br/>(see Aerial &amp; Enhanced Surveillance)"]

flowchart TD
  E["Officer perceives an item<br/>from where he is"] --> Q{Mere observation,<br/>or a seizure?}
  F["Officer FEELS an object during<br/>a lawful Terry frisk"] --> P3
  Q -->|"Merely LOOKING at the knowingly<br/>exposed, without disturbing it<br/>(flashlight on an open car, Brown)"| OBS["No search, no 4A event<br/>(Hicks cursory inspection)"]
  Q -->|"Wants to SEIZE the item"| P1{"1 · Lawfully PRESENT<br/>at the vantage point?"}
  P1 -->|No| BAD["No plain-view seizure"]
  P1 -->|Yes| P2{"2 · Lawful RIGHT OF ACCESS<br/>to the object itself?<br/>(vantage is not access;<br/>Collins curtilage limit)"}
  P2 -->|No| BAD
  P2 -->|Yes| P3{"3 · Incriminating nature<br/>IMMEDIATELY APPARENT?<br/>= probable cause, NOT certainty,<br/>and NO manipulation"}
  P3 -->|"No / had to move, turn,<br/>open, or squeeze it"| MAN["Manipulation = a SEPARATE SEARCH<br/>needing its own PC<br/>(Hicks; Dickerson lump;<br/>cf. flashlight into a closed container,<br/>Herlth / Tarantino, state-illustrative)"]
  P3 -->|Yes| OK["Lawful warrantless SEIZURE<br/>(Horton 3 elements;<br/>inadvertence NOT required)"]

flowchart TD
  A["Search of a person's papers / effects"] --> B{"Who conducted it?"}
  B -->|"Government agent"| G["Full Fourth Amendment scrutiny<br/>(warrant or exception)"]
  B -->|"Private party (no gov't instigation)"| P["Not a Fourth Amendment event<br/>Burdeau"]
  P --> C{"Later government inspection?"}
  C -->|"Within scope of private search"| OK["No new search<br/>Jacobsen (field test · re-exam)"]
  C -->|"Exceeds the private search"| SR["Separate SEARCH — needs justification<br/>Walter (projecting the films)"]
  A --> F{"Search abroad of a nonresident alien?"}
  F -->|Yes| NR["Outside the Amendment<br/>Verdugo-Urquidez ('the people')"]

flowchart TD
    A["Government tracks a person's location"] --> B{"Physical attachment<br/>to an effect?"}
    B -->|"Yes"| S["SEARCH — trespass theory<br/>(Jones)"]
    B -->|"No"| C{"Reveals interior of<br/>a protected space?"}
    C -->|"Yes"| S2["SEARCH — Karo"]
    C -->|"No"| D{"Comprehensive record<br/>over time?"}
    D -->|"Yes — historical CSLI"| S3["SEARCH — Carpenter mosaic"]
    D -->|"No — public movement"| N["Not a search<br/>(Knotts)"]
    D -.->|"real-time CSLI /<br/>tower dump"| R["RESERVED / unsettled"]

flowchart TD
  Q{"Was the person seized?"}
  Q -->|"Physical force<br/>+ intent to restrain<br/>(Brower: means<br/>intentionally applied)"| F["SEIZED at the MOMENT<br/>force is applied.<br/>Submission irrelevant.<br/>(Torres)"]
  Q -->|"Show of authority<br/>(reasonable person not<br/>free to leave? Mendenhall)"| A{"Did the person<br/>SUBMIT?"}
  Q -->|"Neither: mere<br/>presence / pursuit"| C["NOT a seizure.<br/>Consensual encounter.<br/>(Chesternut)"]
  A -->|"No, keeps fleeing"| N["NOT seized<br/>(Hodari D.)"]
  A -->|"Yes, yields"| S["SEIZED<br/>(Hodari D.)"]
  F --> R{"Now: was the seizure<br/>REASONABLE?<br/>(separate question)"}
  S --> R
  R -->|"Consensual: none<br/>Terry stop: RS<br/>Arrest: PC"| LVL["Match the justification<br/>to the intrusion<br/>(Royer, Dunaway, Atwater)"]

flowchart TD
  A["Evidence found after an illegality"] --> Q1{"Also obtained through a lawful source<br/>genuinely independent of the illegality,<br/>not prompted by it? · <i>Murray</i>"}
  Q1 -->|Yes| ADM["ADMITTED — independent source"]
  Q1 -->|No| Q2{"Would it inevitably have been found<br/>by lawful means (preponderance)? · <i>Nix</i>"}
  Q2 -->|"Yes, real route"| ADM2["ADMITTED — inevitable discovery"]
  Q2 -->|"Only speculative"| SUP["SUPPRESS · <i>Neugin</i>"]

flowchart TD
    A[Identification procedure] --> B{Adversary proceedings begun?<br/>Kirby / Rothgery}
    B -->|No: pre-charge| C[No counsel right — Kirby]
    B -->|Yes: post-attachment| D{Corporeal confrontation?}
    D -->|No: photo array| E[No counsel right — Ash]
    D -->|Yes: lineup / show-up / prelim-hearing ID| F{Charged offense? Cobb}
    F -->|No: uncharged| G[No Wade/Gilbert right]
    F -->|Yes| H[Right to counsel — Wade / Gilbert / Moore]
    H --> I{Counsel present or waived?}
    I -->|Yes| J[Identification admissible]
    I -->|No| K[Lineup ID excluded per se — Gilbert<br/>in-court ID only on independent source — Wade]

flowchart TD
    A[Adversary proceedings begun?<br/>charge / indictment / information /<br/>arraignment / initial appearance] -->|No| B[No 6A right<br/>Kirby · Gouveia · Hoffa<br/>Miranda / due process govern]
    A -->|Yes| C[6A attaches<br/>Kirby / Rothgery]
    C --> D{Same charged offense?<br/>Cobb — Blockburger}
    D -->|No, uncharged| J[Outside 6A scope as to this offense<br/>Cobb — questioning on uncharged offense permitted]
    D -->|Yes| E{Deliberate elicitation w/o counsel?<br/>Massiah / Brewer / Fellers / Henry / Moulton}
    E -->|Passive listening post| F[No violation<br/>Kuhlmann]
    E -->|Yes| G{Valid waiver?<br/>Patterson — Miranda warnings;<br/>Montejo — even post-appointment}
    G -->|Yes| H[Statements admissible]
    G -->|No| I[6A violation<br/>suppress<br/>impeachment use OK — Ventris]

flowchart TD
  A["Warrant to search the premises"] --> B{"Person is an occupant<br/>in the immediate vicinity?"}
  B -- Yes --> D["DETAIN: categorical authority<br/><i>Summers</i>; handcuffs / questions OK<br/><i>Muehler</i>; brief command <i>Rettele</i>"]
  B -- "No (former occupant,<br/>stopped away) <i>Bailey</i>" --> O["Needs PC to arrest or RS<br/>for a Terry stop"]
  A --> S{"Want to SEARCH / frisk<br/>a person present?"}
  S -- Yes --> C{"Cause particularized<br/>to THAT person?<br/><i>Ybarra</i>"}
  C -- "No" --> X["No search / frisk<br/>→ fruits suppressed"]
  C -- "Yes (PC / armed-and-dangerous RS)" --> OK["Search / frisk permitted"]

flowchart TD
  A["Challenge the affidavit's truth"] --> B{"Substantial preliminary showing:<br/>knowing/reckless falsehood<br/>necessary to PC?"}
  B -- "No (negligence / conclusory)" --> N["No hearing;<br/>warrant stands"]
  B -- Yes --> H["Franks hearing"]
  H --> C{"Falsity proven by<br/>a preponderance?"}
  C -- No --> N
  C -- Yes --> D["Set false material aside<br/>(or add the omitted fact)"]
  D --> E{"Remaining affidavit<br/>still shows PC?"}
  E -- Yes --> N
  E -- No --> X["Warrant VOID → fruits suppressed<br/>(outside <i>Leon</i> good faith)"]

flowchart TD
  V{"1. VOLUNTARY?<br/>totality · no warning needed<br/><i>Schneckloth</i> · custody = factor <i>Watson</i>"}
  V -->|"No: acquiescence to a claimed warrant/authority (<i>Bumper</i>)"| X["Invalid consent: suppress"]
  V -->|Yes| A{"2. AUTHORITY?<br/>common authority <i>Matlock</i><br/>/ apparent (reasonable) <i>Rodriguez</i><br/>person- &amp; area-specific"}
  A -->|"No (e.g., landlord <i>Chapman</i> / hotel clerk <i>Stoner</i>)"| X
  A -->|Yes| S{"3. SCOPE?<br/>objective reasonableness <i>Jimeno</i><br/>suspect may delimit / withdraw"}
  S -->|"destroy a container?"| D["Needs EXPLICIT authorization<br/>or independent basis <i>Osage</i>"]
  S --> OK["Valid consent search<br/>(within scope)"]
  A -.->|co-tenant dispute| C{"Objector physically present?"}
  C -->|"Yes, objecting"| BLK["Blocked as to objector<br/><i>Randolph</i>"]
  C -->|"No: lawfully removed"| OK2["Remaining tenant may consent<br/><i>Fernandez</i>"]

flowchart TD
  A["Officer approaches a home to speak with occupants<br/>(knock and talk — no warrant)"] --> AREA{"AREA / route:<br/>customary path to the door,<br/>or a small departure a visitor would make?<br/><i>Walker</i>"}
  AREA -->|"deviates into curtilage<br/>(back yard, peering around)"| SRCH["SEARCH of curtilage —<br/>needs warrant / exception<br/><i>Jardines · Lundin</i>"]
  AREA -->|"front-door confinement +<br/>perimeter positioning"| SPLIT["CIRCUIT SPLIT (open)<br/>1st / 3d / 6th: front door only,<br/>no flanking (<i>French · Morgan</i>)<br/>11th: visitor-plausible departures OK<br/>SCOTUS reserved (<i>Carroll v. Carman</i>)"]
  AREA -->|Yes| PURP{"PURPOSE: to ask questions,<br/>NOT to conduct a search?<br/>(objective test) <i>Jardines · Walker</i>"}
  PURP -->|"dog / peering / snooping"| SRCH
  PURP -->|Yes| TIME{"TIME: a reasonable hour<br/>a visitor would knock?<br/><i>Lundin</i> — 4 a.m. exceeds"}
  TIME -->|"middle of the night,<br/>no weighty reason"| SRCH
  TIME -->|Yes| MAN{"MANNER: knock, wait briefly,<br/>and leave if unanswered / refused?<br/><i>French</i>"}
  MAN -->|"overstay / repeated<br/>intrusion after refusal"| SRCH
  MAN -->|Yes| OK["Lawful approach — NOT a search.<br/>Plain view from the door;<br/>NO entry, seizure, or sense-enhancing search.<br/>Anything more needs valid consent"]

flowchart TD
  A["Closed container in police control"] --> B{"Found in a car police may<br/>search on probable cause?"}
  B -->|Yes| C["Open on the spot:<br/>automobile exception<br/><i>Acevedo · Ross</i>"]
  B -->|No| D{"Another exception in play?<br/>consent · SITA · inventory ·<br/>exigency · plain view · border"}
  D -->|Yes| E["Open within that exception's scope<br/>(no destruction · <i>Osage</i>)"]
  D -->|No| F["Warrant required<br/><i>Chadwick</i>"]

flowchart TD
  Q{"Warrantless action on a pure<br/>caretaking / welfare basis?<br/>(noncriminal, NOT a Terry crime stop)"}
  Q -->|"HOME / inside a residence"| H["BARRED: no freestanding 'community<br/>caretaking' entry into the home (<i>Caniglia</i>)<br/>route through <b>Emergency Aid</b> / exigency"]
  Q -->|"VEHICLE / roadside / impound"| V["Caretaking handling reasonable if genuinely<br/>noncriminal + objective basis (<i>Cady</i>);<br/>inventory under STANDARDIZED procedures,<br/>not a pretext (<i>Opperman</i> · <i>Bertine</i>)"]
  Q -->|"PERSON in public"| P["<i>Garner</i> 3-part test:<br/>1 · specific &amp; articulable facts of need<br/>2 · gov't interest outweighs liberty<br/>3 · scope + duration tailored<br/>(<i>Rideau</i>: impaired person in roadway)"]
  P --> P2{"Welfare purpose<br/>satisfied?"}
  P2 -->|Yes| P3["Person goes free UNLESS independent<br/>reasonable suspicion of crime (<i>Garner</i>)"]
  P --> M{"SERIOUS mental-health<br/>seizure?"}
  M -->|Yes| M2["Needs PROBABLE CAUSE of dangerousness;<br/>'caretaking' label is a category error (<i>Graham</i>)"]

flowchart TD
  A["Warrantless action to prevent<br/>destruction of evidence"] --> PC{"Probable cause + genuine,<br/>imminent risk of destruction?"}
  PC -->|No| X0["No destruction exigency"]
  PC -->|Yes| K{"Did police CREATE the exigency by<br/>threatening a 4A violation? (<i>King</i>)"}
  K -->|Yes| X1["Forfeited; suppress"]
  K -->|"No (e.g. lawful knock-and-announce)"| T{"Natural dissipation<br/>(alcohol / evanescent)?"}
  T -->|Yes| D["Totality, NOT per se (<i>McNeely</i>);<br/>near-automatic only for the<br/>unconscious driver (<i>Mitchell</i>);<br/>limited seizure of evanescent<br/>evidence on the person (<i>Cupp</i>)"]
  T -->|No| E["Act to prevent destruction,<br/>scope tied to the risk"]
  K --> FREEZE["If you only need to PRESERVE:<br/>freeze &amp; get a warrant<br/>(<i>McArthur · Segura</i>; Securing the Scene)"]

flowchart TD
  Q{"Warrantless entry of a home<br/>to render aid / prevent injury?"}
  Q --> B{"Objectively reasonable BASIS to BELIEVE<br/>an occupant is seriously injured or<br/>imminently threatened?<br/>(<i>Brigham City</i> · <i>Fisher</i> · <i>Case v. Montana</i>)<br/><b>'basis to believe', NOT 'see it'</b><br/>source-agnostic · objective · at the moment of entry"}
  B -->|"No: bare 'caretaking' / generalized concern"| X["No warrantless entry.<br/><i>Caniglia</i>: no caretaking shortcut into the home;<br/>need consent, warrant, or genuine exigency"]
  B -->|"Yes, incl. imminent violence (<i>Ryburn</i>)"| A["Enter to aid · seize plain-view evidence during<br/>legitimate emergency activities · prompt protective<br/>look for other victims (&rarr; <b>Securing the Scene</b>).<br/>Quantum = <i>Brigham City</i> reasonableness,<br/>'no further gloss' (<i>Case v. Montana</i>)"]
  A --> E{"Emergency resolved?"}
  E -->|Yes| L["Exception ENDS; scope was tied to the emergency.<br/>Later evidence-gathering entry needs a WARRANT:<br/>homicide (<i>Mincey</i>) or fire (<i>Tyler</i> / <i>Clifford</i>)"]

flowchart TD
  A["Warrantless entry claimed under exigency"] --> PC{"Probable cause?"}
  PC -->|No| X0["No exigency exception; suppress"]
  PC -->|Yes| B{"Genuine exigency,<br/>NOT police-created? (<i>King</i>)"}
  B -->|"created by 4A-violating /<br/>threatened conduct"| X1["Forfeited; suppress (<i>King</i> bar)"]
  B -->|Yes| C{"Which exigency?"}
  C --> D["HOT / FRESH PURSUIT<br/><i>Hayden · Santana</i>"]
  C --> E["EVIDENCE DESTRUCTION<br/>&rarr; <b>Destruction of Evidence</b>"]
  C --> F["LIFE / SAFETY &rarr; emergency aid<br/>&rarr; <b>Emergency Aid</b> (<i>Caniglia</i> home-bar)"]
  D --> CONT{"Pursuit immediate &amp;<br/>CONTINUOUS at entry?<br/>(brief pause OK, <i>Newman</i>)"}
  CONT -->|"continuity broke"| X2["No hot-pursuit exigency"]
  CONT -->|"intact"| G{"Minor / misdemeanor offense?"}
  G -->|Yes| H["No categorical rule;<br/>case-by-case (<i>Welsh · Lange</i>)"]
  G -->|No| I["Felony pursuit / genuine emergency<br/>crosses threshold (<i>Hayden · Santana</i>)"]
  D --> SCOPE["Scope tied to the emergency;<br/>no 'seriousness' exception (<i>Mincey</i>);<br/>or freeze &amp; get a warrant (<i>McArthur · Segura</i>)"]

flowchart TD
  A["Suspicionless / no-warrant search or seizure"] --> B{"Primary purpose =<br/>ordinary crime control?"}
  B -->|Yes| X["FAILS: no special-needs discount<br/>(Ferguson · Edmond)"]
  B -->|"No: special need beyond<br/>ordinary law enforcement"| C{"Persons / programme,<br/>or premises inspection?"}
  C -->|"Persons & programmes"| D["BALANCE: gov't interest<br/>vs privacy intrusion<br/>(no warrant / PC)"]
  C -->|"Premises (regulatory)"| E{"Closely / pervasively<br/>regulated industry?"}
  E -->|No| F["AREA WARRANT on legislative<br/>standards + pre-compliance review<br/>(Camara · See · Barlow's · Patel)"]
  E -->|Yes| G["No warrant IF Burger 3-part test met<br/>(Burger · Biswell · Donovan)"]
  D --> H["Schools: T.L.O. · Vernonia · Earls · Safford<br/>Probation/Parole: Griffin · Knights · Samson<br/>Testing: Skinner · Von Raab (Chandler fails)<br/>Workplace: O'Connor · Quon<br/>Custodial intake: King · Florence · Bell"]

flowchart TD
  A["Suspicionless checkpoint / roadblock<br/>(every car or every nth car)"] --> B{"Primary purpose =<br/>ordinary crime control?"}
  B -->|"Yes (e.g. drug interdiction)"| X["UNCONSTITUTIONAL<br/>however orderly (Edmond)"]
  B -->|"No: highway safety /<br/>information-seeking /<br/>immigration"| C{"Neutral, systematic plan<br/>+ favorable Brown balance?"}
  C -->|"Roving / discretionary"| X2["INVALID (Prouse)"]
  C -->|Yes| OK["Valid suspicionless stop:<br/>Sitz (sobriety) · Lidster (info) ·<br/>Martinez-Fuerte (immigration).<br/>Brief only; more needs RS / PC"]

flowchart TD
  A["Police take custody of a vehicle<br/>or an arrestee's property"] --> B{"Lawful impoundment / booking<br/>on a caretaking basis?"}
  B -->|No| X["No inventory footing:<br/>need PC, warrant, or another theory"]
  B -->|Yes| C{"Standardized policy governs<br/>what is inventoried & which<br/>containers are opened?"}
  C -->|"No policy / uncanalized discretion"| X2["INVALID (Wells)"]
  C -->|Yes| D{"Carried out to produce an<br/>inventory, not as a ruse<br/>to hunt for evidence?"}
  D -->|"Ruse / departs from routine"| X3["INVALID (Wells · Bertine)"]
  D -->|Yes| OK["Valid inventory:<br/>catalog reasonable, containers<br/>per policy (Opperman · Bertine ·<br/>Lafayette at booking)"]
